// Ticks come after edits and reorders; deletes come last and only for the top-most
// node (delete is recursive). b is ticked in a list that is also reordered: it is
// not in the target order and is never moved. The delete of e reports its 2 hidden
// descendants.
== config
force
== remote
home
  root
    a A
    b B
      b1 B one
    c C
    d D
    e E
      e1 E one
        e11 E deep
      e2 Done [x]
        e21 Under done
    f F
== merged
root
  c C
  b B two [x]
    b1 B one
  a A
  d D
  f F
== ops
update-name b "B" -> "B two"
move c to root top (from root)
complete b
delete e (hidden 2)
